abstract: "Benchmarks and compose files for Qwen3.6-35B-A3B on one NVIDIA DGX Spark (GB10, sm_121) with vLLM: FP8 vs NVFP4, MTP and DFlash speculative decoding, Marlin vs FlashInfer b12x MoE kernels, vLLM 0.23 vs 0.25. Notes are in Japanese with an English summary."
